  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb based on *encontrar*. Uses reflexive pronouns (me/te/se/nos/se) in all tenses.",
    "o→ue stem change in presente: all forms except *nosotros* (*encuentro, encuentras, encuentra, encuentran*).",
    "Stem change does NOT apply to past tenses, future, or conditional.",
    "*Me encuentro muy cansado hoy.* (I find myself very tired today.)",
    "*El hotel se encuentra cerca del centro.* (The hotel is located near the centre.)",
    "*Nos encontramos con unos amigos en el café.* (We met up with some friends at the café.)",
    "Related: *encontrar* (to find — transitive), *el encuentro* (meeting, encounter)"
  ],
